    "sub_name": "數位行銷",
    "sub_ename": "DIGITAL MARKETING",
    "describe_ch": "這門課程旨在使學生熟悉快速增長的數位行銷和社交數位策略領域。課程將深入探討成功推廣組織所使用的基本原則和方法。該課程旨在提供基本的數位行銷技能，以及對數位行銷技術及其實際應用的深入理解。由於本課程的性質，學生必須能夠輕鬆使用各種社交媒體工具和帳戶，包括Twitter、LinkedIn、YouTube、Google、Instagram和Facebook。",
    "describe_eh": "This course seeks to familiarize students with the rapidly increasing realm of digital marketing and social digital strategy. It will delve into the fundamental principles and methods use d to successfully promote an organization . The course aims to provide essential digital ma rketing skills and a thorough comprehension of digital marketing technologies and their practical use. Because of the nature of this course, students must have easy access to a variety of social media tools and accounts on Twitter, LinkedIn, YouTube, Google, Instagram, and Facebook.",
